	"data": "Module 1: Document Source — Implementation Detail\n\nPart of the Custom RAG Pipeline. See custom-rag-pipeline.md for the full system map.\n\nOverview\n\nThe document source module watches the vault filesystem for changes and pushes them to the ingest queue. It's the pipeline's eyes — the simplest module by design, with a single responsibility: detect changes and emit events.\n\nTwo modes of operation:\nStartup scan — walks the vault on boot, compares against SQLite, pushes new/changed files\nLive watcher…",
